# Spreadsheet changelog

The live model for each ticker is a Google Sheet. Git will not see those edits unless you record them.

After **any** write to a spreadsheet (formulas, values, notes, formats, charts, or row/column insert/delete), append a dated entry to **`models/{TICKER}/CHANGELOG.md`** before finishing. Do not skip small cell edits. Identify the ticker from `--ticker`, `OPEN_MODEL_TICKER`, or `config/settings.json` (`default_ticker`). Repo/tooling-only changes go in the root `CHANGELOG.md`.

Each entry must include:

- Tab and A1 range
- Insert/delete: dimension, start index, count
- Formulas: before → after (one template is enough if copied across columns)
- Data values changed, and why
- Side effects (charts, notes, number formats) if you noticed them

Use the template at the top of that ticker’s `CHANGELOG.md`. One heading per change-set, not per cell.
